msgid ""
"Glimpse failed to load its scanner module. Try reinstalling the plugin."
msgstr ""
"Theip ar Glimpse a mhodúl scanacháin a lódáil. Bain triail as an mbreiseán a"
" athshuiteáil."

msgid ""
"Glimpse works with EPUB books only (this document format is not supported)."
msgstr ""
"Ní oibríonn Glimpse ach le leabhair EPUB (ní thacaítear leis an bhformáid "
"cháipéise seo)."

