msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Leid: oscail Glimpse láithreach le gotha.\n"
"\n"
"Socraigh ceann faoi Socruithe → Tapáil agus gothaí → Bainisteoir gothaí → roghnaigh gotha → Léitheoir → 'Oscail Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(Taispeántar an leid seo uair amháin.)"

msgid "Mode: Show all images"
msgstr "Mód: Taispeáin gach íomhá"

msgid "Mode: Show images up to current chapter"
msgstr "Mód: Taispeáin íomhánna go dtí an chaibidil reatha"

msgid "Show images up to current chapter"
msgstr "Taispeáin íomhánna go dtí an chaibidil reatha"

msgid ""
"Images that appear beyond your current position stay hidden, so you can't "
"spoil yourself. Granularity is per chapter: images in the chapter you are "
"currently reading are shown."
msgstr ""
"Fanann íomhánna a thagann chun cinn thar do shuíomh reatha i bhfolach, ionas"
" nach spoilfidh tú duit féin. Tá an mhionghráinneacht de réir caibidle: "
"taispeántar íomhánna sa chaibidil atá á léamh agat faoi láthair."

msgid "Show all images"
msgstr "Taispeáin gach íomhá"

msgid ""
"Show reference images from anywhere in the book, including parts you haven't"
" reached yet."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin íomhánna tagartha ó áit ar bith sa leabhar, na codanna nár shroich"
" tú fós san áireamh."

